    airo:evidenceText "Argentina’s Agency for Access to Public Information (AAIP) investigates Worldcoin." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7567" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bcef645b2647> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "And the Worldcoin Foundation, a non-profit arm incorporated in the Cayman Islands with the goal of stewarding the growth of the Worldcoin protocol and its associated ecosystem, recently awarded the first grants through its Worldcoin Community Grants Program." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5978" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c7d20f48ca83> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Kenya was among the first nations to raise flags about the collection of iris biometrics in exchange for free crypto tokens; authorities there raided local Worldcoin offices in August 2023." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5978" .

